Rename this file to  anthropic.local.key  (remove ".example") and replace the
line below with your real Anthropic API key from https://console.anthropic.com/
(Settings -> API Keys -> Create Key). Add a credit balance under Billing.

Once present, the three scheduled tasks (Blog, Qwoted, Outreach) automatically
bill per-use through this key instead of your Claude Pro/Max subscription — so
they keep running even if the subscription lapses. Your interactive Claude Code
use is unaffected. This file is gitignored; never commit the real key.

sk-ant-REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-REAL-KEY
